{
  "title": "Cafe",
  "arabicTitle": "المقهى",
  "level": "A1",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "Ben walks into a small café near his office. It is lunchtime, and the café is busy. He looks at the menu on the wall."
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Hello! What would you like today?\" says the man behind the counter."
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Hi. Can I have a sandwich, please?\" Ben says."
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Sure. We have chicken, cheese, and egg. Which one do you want?\""
    },
    {
      "text": "Ben thinks for a moment. \"I'll have the chicken sandwich, please.\""
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Good choice. Anything to drink?\""
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Yes, please. A coffee. Small, with milk.\""
    },
    {
      "text": "\"That's one chicken sandwich and one small coffee with milk. Anything else?\""
    },
    {
      "text": "\"No, that's all. How much is it?\""
    },
    {
      "text": "\"That's six dollars,\" says the man."
    },
    {
      "text": "Ben pays and takes a seat by the window. A few minutes later, the man brings his food."
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Here you are. Enjoy your lunch!\""
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Thank you very much,\" Ben says with a smile."
    },
    {
      "text": "He eats his sandwich slowly. He watches people walk outside. It is a nice, quiet lunch break."
    }
  ],
